  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "### Added\n\n- `Polyline2D` and `Polyline3D` now have `tryFind`, `tryFindLast`, `tryFindIndex`, and `tryFindLastIndex` point-search helpers.`iterSkipLast` and `iterPtSkipLast` point iteration helpers.`iterSegments` and `iterLineSegments` segment iteration helpers.\n- `Rect2D` and `Rect3D` now has `iterPointsCCW`, `iterPointsLoopedCCW`, `iterPointsCW`, and `iterPointsLoopedCW` corner iteration helpers.\n- `distanceToXY` and `distanceToXYZ` functions on `Pt` and `Pnt`",
